  "question": {
    "text": "A block of mass <math><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo></math> lying on a smooth horizontal surface, is attached to a spring (of negligible mass) of spring constant <math><mi>k</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The other end of the spring is fixed, as shown in the figure. The block is initially at rest in its equilibrium position. If now the block is pulled with a constant force <math><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo></math> the maximum speed of the block is:<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/gkvndhgfanlffeeyiwvnmuwttbylfqtrpnkjygclvmgynvyjiq.png\" />",
    "image": null
